**Sealed publication and reader worksheet.** Publication has no allocator call or replacement payload. Its literal tariff is `51+91*N+8*C+2*w+9+26`. The first 51 is charged before fixed authentication; the remaining bulk is prepaid before source, partition and attachment traversal. The fixed metadata visits below are counted individually, not hidden in an owner-check allowance.

