The delivery order is (`step:nrz:backlog-dyadic-power`). The scalar schedule supplies its own bounded step inventory and proof under (`req:nrz:transcendental-power-schedule`). Retained preparation supplies exact correspondence, bounded authority/key/proof storage and individually funded lifetime evidence; masked application supplies its own original and one-cell invocation allowance, byte inventory, refusal prefixes, resource boundaries, endpoint/readings controls and every ordered cross-member substitution control. No expm1 tariff, ABI figure or zero allowance is assigned by analogy. The dyadic owner and its uses have their own debit variants and H, E and U under (`rule:nrz:matrix-loans-prepared-owner-resources`), with owner admission in the combined form P+(G-J)+M+S and further uses following that rule's separate U and S_use admission without charging H, E or the graph reservation again. Existing members retain their pins. The observation spans and accounting manifest of (`req:nrz:transcendental-observation-evidence`) accompany those implementations, including native operations outside exact Work, attempted construction, warm reuse and release. The measurement harness and subsequent record discharge (`req:nrz:transcendental-measurements`), with measured sharpness distinct from outward inclusion. No numerical allowance or measured profile is selected by this contract.

For retained preparation, select the construction and public refusal-prefix obligations of (`req:nrz:matrix-loans-prepared-owner-controls`), private correspondence-guard controls, independent retained numerical readings at admitted positive points and normal-threshold neighbors, independent inventories and combined constructor/further-use boundaries with active reservations, and owner/use allocation-prefix cleanup, unwind, stopped and repeated scan/reconciliation controls. Negative and zero expm1 evaluation points are not admitted power inputs; attachment, repair and publication obligations remain with masked application. Prove external construction, supplied-authority admission, graph mutation/extraction, cloning and escaped evaluation authority impossible; inspect every test item for its required documentation. Pin N and N-1 for the combined owner boundary with a live producing-graph registration, and S_use and its one-below boundary without charging H, E or G again. The private bundle-pin, repair, publication-prefix and attachment substitution clauses of that requirement are deferred to the shared attachment representation with masked application; the existing 8-byte attachment slot and common header do not change in retention. The selected tests do not claim those deferred clauses. The six controls are (`[BINDINGS-test:unit:dyadic-power-correspondence]`), (`[MATRIX-test:unit:retained-dyadic-power-pairing]`), (`[MATRIX-test:unit:retained-dyadic-power-inventory]`), (`[MATRIX-test:unit:retained-dyadic-power-resources]`), (`[MATRIX-test:unit:retained-dyadic-power-lifetime]`) and (`[MATRIX-test:unit:retained-dyadic-power-observation]`). Public construction cannot supply a mismatched program or checked request: the correspondence causes are exercised at their private comparison helpers, not represented as reachable public refusal fixtures.

